---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import ElPasoMountain from "../../assets/ElPasoMountain.jpg";
import Headshot from "../../assets/Headshot_Sepulveda_2026.jpg";
import { UserCircle } from "lucide-astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Me | Fernando Sepulveda"
  description="Professional biography of Fernando Sepulveda."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mt-10 animate-fade-in-up">
    <div class="mb-12 flex items-center space-x-6">
      <div
        class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 glass w-24 h-24 flex-shrink-0 bg-white/5"
      >
        <Image
          src={Headshot}
          alt="Fernando Sepulveda Headshot"
          width={192}
          height={192}
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
          Professional <span class="text-gradient">Biography</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mt-2">
          Get to know the person behind the code.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="glass p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-white/10"
    >
      <!-- Decorative gradient blob -->
      <div
        class="absolute top-0 right-0 -mr-20 -mt-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]/20 blur-3xl"
      >
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative z-10 prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none text-[var(--color-text-main)] space-y-6 leading-relaxed"
      >
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium leading-relaxed text-white">
          Hi, I'm Fernando Sepulveda— I'm currently pursuing a Master's degree
          in Computer Science at The University of Texas at El Paso. I'm
          passionate about using technology to solve meaningful problems,
          especially in areas like artificial intelligence, cybersecurity,
          automation, and accessible design.
        </p>

        <div
          class="my-10 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 glass shadow-2xl bg-black/20 w-full aspect-[3/1]"
        >
          <Image
            src={ElPasoMountain}
            alt="El Paso Mountain"
            width={1200}
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-bottom hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="group hover:bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all duration-300">
          <span class="block mb-2 text-[var(--color-text-main)] transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:font-bold group-hover:text-white">Previously</span>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] m-0">
            I built a versatile foundation across software
            engineering, autonomous systems, and advanced manufacturing through
            hands-on academic research and industry internships. My early research
            in the additive manufacturing space inspired me to found my own 3D
            printing marketplace startup—an idea that later took first place in a
            university pitch competition. Alongside my entrepreneurial ventures, I
            developed automated enterprise cloud tools, contributed to smart
            factory machine learning initiatives, and published research on
            cyber-secure adaptive cruise control for autonomous vehicles.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="group hover:bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all duration-300">
          <span class="block mb-2 text-[var(--color-text-main)] transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:font-bold group-hover:text-white">Currently</span>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] m-0">
            I am pursuing a Master of Science in Computer Science
            with a specialized focus on artificial intelligence, deep learning,
            and computer vision. My day-to-day work sits at the intersection of
            advanced research and practical application: I design computer vision
            architectures and autonomous navigation systems as an AI research
            intern, while also serving as a Graduate Research Fellow where I
            mentor student entrepreneurs to turn AI-driven academic concepts into
            scalable, market-ready startups.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="group hover:bg-white/5 p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-[var(--color-primary)] transition-all duration-300">
          <span class="block mb-2 text-[var(--color-text-main)] transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:font-bold group-hover:text-white">In the future</span>
          <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)] m-0">
            As a lifelong learner who believes that consistency
            and quality drive success, I plan to continuously expand my technical
            mastery—including contemplating a Ph.D. down the line. I want to work
            on cutting-edge technologies that provide tangible real-world value,
            particularly within autonomous vehicle systems, while channeling my
            entrepreneurial spirit into launching a business that directly
            benefits society. Ultimately, my goal is to lift as I climb by giving
            back to the community, establishing scholarships, and creating
            meaningful learning opportunities for young aspiring students.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xl font-medium text-gradient inline-block">
          Thanks for stopping by my portfolio—feel free to explore my work or
          reach out!
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
